    "passage": "Step 1: Đọc hiểu câu hỏi + imagine paraphrase\n\nQuestion: difficulties in cultivating process\n\n'difficulties' -> Bài đọc có thể sẽ nói về những vấn đề gặp phải khi nuôi trồng pearlscultivating process -> Bài đọc có thể sẽ mô tả quy trình nuôi trông pearls\n\nStep 2: Tìm thứ imagine + xác định info\n\n'difficulties' -> takes several years + irritant may be rejected + the pearl may be seriously deformed + oyster may directly die...Cultivating process -> process/method used to get pearls\n\nĐoạn E paraphrase 'cultivating process' thành the 'process/method used to get pearls'\n\n=> Từ đó ta xác định được info ở đoạn E \n\nStep 2: Áp dụng Linearthinking để đọc hiểu main idea.\n\n1  No matter which method is used to get pearls ,  the process   usually  takes several years.   \n\n2   Mussels must reach a mature age  ,  which may take up almost three years  , and  then be transplanted an irritant.   \n\n3  When the irritant is put in place  ,   it takes approximately another three years  for a pearl to reach its full size  . \n\n4 Sometimes,  the irritant   may be rejected.  \n\n5  As a result  ,  the pearl    may be seriously deformed  , or  the oyster    may directly die   ...\n\n6 At the end of a 5- to 10-year circle,  only half of the oysters    may have made it through.  \n\nMain idea\n\n1 Describe the time it takes to get pearls\n\n2 + 3 The detailed process of raising pearls from mussels.\n\n4 + 5 + 6 Describe the difficulties that may arise from the process. \n\n takes several years +  may be rejected + pearl may be seriously deformed + die from diseases + only half made it through \n\n=> These are the difficulties mentioned in the paraphrasing section. \n\n=> The answer is E",
